cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GameAnything-Bench, please cite the paper below."
title: "GameAnything-Bench"
abstract: >-
  The benchmark of GameAnything: coding agents take a multimodal reference
  (video, images, text or a mix) and the development kit of a real game, and
  build or edit a playable mod that brings the reference into the game.
